/// Base raw URL of the Contoso Retail Parquet files, hosted in the PUBLIC SampleDataSets repo
/// (github.com/CSalcedoDataBI/SampleDataSets → contoso-retail/). Hosting the data there lets THIS
/// reference repo stay private while the model still refreshes for ANYONE over raw.githubusercontent
/// — no auth, no SQL Server, no local paths. A real M PARAMETER (IsParameterQuery) so every partition
/// stays firewall-safe. To use a fork, branch, tag or a local mirror, change this single value
/// (a folder URL, without a trailing slash).
expression DataBaseUrl = "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CSalcedoDataBI/SampleDataSets/main/contoso-retail" meta [IsParameterQuery=true, Type="Text", IsParameterQueryRequired=true]
	lineageTag: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000d0

	annotation PBI_ResultType = Text

